#: fd7343cae7264c998b054248ab749737
msgid "SimpleBGC Gimbal (aka AlexMos gimbal)"
msgstr "SimpleBGC云台（又称AlexMos云台）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:7
#: 5c3434980e7c40898586b5306fce877a 89338204b222432eb09786da8f797cb0
#: a530cf3bb89f499c8a6ce4e8cdffaa52 aaee75cf3b924b0fac9212e5d2d1a694
#: ca4e3605f48f40d1bbcc52d55cde0859
msgid ""
"The SimpleBGC is a popular brushless gimbal controller that can communicate "
"with ArduPilot (Copter, Plane, and Rover) using MAVLink or a custom serial "
"protocol. More details on the capabilities of this gimbal can be found at "
"`basecamelectronics.com <https://www.basecamelectronics.com/>`__"
msgstr ""
"SimpleBGC是一款流行的无刷云台控制器，可通过MAVLink或自定义串行协议与ArduPilot（Copter、Plane和Rover）通信。有关此云台功能的更多详情，请访问"
" `basecamelectronics.com <https://www.basecamelectronics.com/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:10
#: 029ea94415c747ea92858d38eed730f1 0410bb4c13f442069c25b9c804b68aa6
