":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` to 7 (\"AlexMos Gimbal Serial\")"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设为7（「AlexMos Gimbal Serial」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:33
#: 0a778ddaf1224cbfa5caf997b26b46fb 4b65de8f7c24437ca45b1cc8d42eec25
#: 6d149d16c3b349ed96034c6521f706c4 7db00236319e4f7ca167535b65f06dab
#: b99ccb89d7964d29b6e03a80965fbd70
msgid ""
"If you are unable to connect you may wish to set the following parameters "
"although normally this should not be required:"
msgstr "如果无法连接，您可能需要设置以下参数，尽管通常不需要："

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:35
#: 3a3661c3129f470eb7cdeba4d62c9d11 7092163f9da14c2cb464ccfb5e943a8c
#: 9e04c130d8fb47fe8c03d27f49cecee5 a1fad87b00b341c88dcaf74bc58e6072
#: ff3fa5b3c2764ecea1223b69f94564f1
