":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` to 115 (means use serial baudrate of "
"115200)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` 设为115（表示使用115200波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:36
#: 386139d2b99c44c783e2a2b82c15bdbf 64eaf2932ec54060b4d294f6f92af3c2
#: 7dc145e5f2094146872c76dc00a0eaac d43b5dbdcf9041248784a964c5de014c
#: d6077404bc214136945489cb541e6929
msgid ""
":ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` to 0 to disable flow control on "
"Telem2 (use BRD_SER1_RSCTS if connecting to Serial1, Serial4/5 never uses "
"flow control)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` 设为 0 以禁用 Telem2 上的流控（若连接至 Serial1 "
"则使用 BRD_SER1_RSCTS，Serial4/5 从不使用流控）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:38
#: 1fd07cabc10b497da381c609a93b0bf3 68163dfbddb54fb1b51d677b4ec6d247
#: ce56f9a929a642c5b5ecf3d039013e54 dcb7f7d93de749afa236cbc832662bcb
#: f694e2f991104eb7ab824ea907551232
