msgstr "云台的最大倾斜角度可通过以下参数设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:40
#: 484493d80ffe488eaa52d1520c993269 51b24c73cf0048b484be64ed27a02b89
#: 7686dfa8b8944ff2b166592e69005be8 898c77c20302421cbbd3bccd2c13dc93
#: bd5b93aade5e4af9a390533865f3a3e2
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>`, :ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` "
"to -30 and 30 to limit the roll angle to 30 degrees in each direction"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>`、:ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` "
"分别设为 -30 和 30，将横滚角限制在各方向 30 度以内"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:41
#: 3be1bc0ae6654053aef97a17da82eb46 4e40b9b101a44e15bd554b40f5c6b335
#: 5bd54f77aeb041cfaca3509b2b1b7be5 70ed45b5ebb54362800f54f34427a5ed
#: fb5c3d9ca66a44189b1e57be237a215c
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>`, :ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX "
"<MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` to -90 and 0 to limit the gimbal to point between straight"
" down (-90 degrees) and straight forward (0 degrees)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>`、:ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX "
"<MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` 分别设为 -90 和 0，将云台限制在正下方（-90 度）到正前方（0 度）之间"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simplebgc-gimbal.rst:42
#: 144a0a8003754d4bbc247a568dd8727b 7acd42fb7bf142f6aba35956341320c1
#: b307083b90f3430ab7323a2de0083c16 d9b226d519b84b919288d10a1839383b
#: f7a73d3f42e34a48acd906d6aae7bf16
msgid ""
"For 3-axis gimbals with 360 degrees of yaw set :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN "
"<MNT1_YAW_MIN>`, :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` to -180 and 180 "
"respectively"
msgstr ""
"对于具有 360 度偏航的三轴云台，将 :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>`、:ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX "
"<MNT1_YAW_MAX>` 分别设为 -180 和 180"

